PART 4 - SERIALIZABLE: two librarians add a charge to the SAME fine
==========================================================================
[reset] UPDATE fine SET amount=1500.00 WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[reset]   -> UPDATE 1
[Terminal A] BEGIN ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE
[Terminal A]   -> BEGIN
[Terminal A] SELECT fine_id, amount FROM fine WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[Terminal A]   -> ['fine_id', 'amount']: [(25288, Decimal('1500.00'))]
[Terminal B] BEGIN ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE
[Terminal B]   -> BEGIN
[Terminal B] SELECT fine_id, amount FROM fine WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[Terminal B]   -> ['fine_id', 'amount']: [(25288, Decimal('1500.00'))]
[Terminal A] UPDATE fine SET amount = amount + 100 WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[Terminal A]   -> UPDATE 1
[Terminal B] UPDATE fine SET amount = amount + 200 WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[Terminal B] (still running after 1.5 s: True)
[observer] SELECT application_name, state, wait_event_type, wait_event FROM pg_stat_activity WHERE application_name = %s
[observer]   -> ['application_name', 'state', 'wait_event_type', 'wait_event']: [('Terminal B', 'active', 'Lock', 'transactionid')]
[observer] => Terminal B is BLOCKED, waiting for a lock held by the other session
[Terminal A] COMMIT
[Terminal A]   -> COMMIT
[Terminal B] ERROR:  could not serialize access due to concurrent update
[Terminal B] -> ERROR (SQLSTATE 40001)
[Terminal B] ROLLBACK
[Terminal B]   -> ROLLBACK
[check] SELECT amount FROM fine WHERE fine_id=(SELECT f.fine_id FROM fine f JOIN loan l ON l.loan_id=f.loan_id WHERE l.member_id=9301 LIMIT 1)
[check]   -> ['amount']: [(Decimal('1600.00'),)]
RESULT PART 4: final amount = 1600.00 (1500 + A's 100 only; B must retry, no lost update)

